<title>UK: CNA NAMES MACGINNITIE CHIEF FINNACIAL OFFICER.</title>
<headline>CNA NAMES MACGINNITIE CHIEF FINNACIAL OFFICER.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>W. James MacGinnitie has been named chief financial officer and senior vice president of insurer CNA, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>MacGinnitie replaces Peter E. Jokiel, who was promoted to president of CNA Life in April of this year.</p>
<p>MacGinnitie comes to CNA from Ernst &amp; Young LLP, where he has been a partner and national director of actuarial services since 1994.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Insurance News +44 171 542 2769</p>
